Package: com.adarsh.stageduoplus
Name: Dynamic Stage+
Version: 1.0.5
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: Add-on for Dynamic Stage 1.2 (tomt000). A floating button that hides the keyboard, an optional auto-swap that moves the app you're using to the top window, and Samsung-style App Pairs from the app icon's long-press menu.
Maintainer: Adarsh
Author: Adarsh
Section: Tweaks
Depends: ellekit, preferenceloader, me.tomt000.stageduo (>= 1.2)
